{"unit_id": "tag:01W9:statement", "translation": "H-射影态射（projective morphism）是 H-拟射影（quasi-projective）的。\nH-射影态射（projective morphism）是射影（projective）的。\n", "allowed_english": ["H-"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影"}, {"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射", "context": "第一个断言的主语，受 H- 限定。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影", "context": "第一个断言的结论，受 H- 限定。"}, {"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射", "context": "第二个断言的主语，受 H- 限定。"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "第二个断言所述的态射性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01W9:proof", "translation": "第一个断言直接由定义得出。\n第二个断言成立，因为<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>上的射影（projective）丛（bundle），见《构造》一章的引理<REF_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "bundle", "target_term": "丛"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "限定第二个断言的证明中所用的丛。"}, {"source_term": "bundle", "target_term": "丛", "context": "说明第二个断言所依据的射影丛。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01WB:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）之间的一个态射（morphism）。\n下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>是局部射影（projective）的。\n<STRUCT_0003> 存在一个开覆盖（covering）<MATH_0003>，使得每个<MATH_0004>都是 H-射影（projective）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": ["H-"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理开头所设态射的源和靶。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理开头所设的概形之间的映射。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "说明下列两个条件的逻辑关系。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第一个条件中讨论局部射影性的对象。"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "第一个条件中的性质，受“局部”限定。"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "第二个条件中要求存在的开覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "第二个条件中逐项要求的性质，受 H- 限定。"}], "notes": []}
